The script output above is a JSON array of new Substack newsletter emails. Each
object has the following fields: subject, from_name, newsletter, date, preview,
message_id.

For each newsletter in the array, write:

  1. One sentence stating the main topic or central argument of the post.
  2. One to three sentences summarising the post content based on the preview.

Present the results as a digest. Use the newsletter name and date as a heading
for each entry. If the array is empty, output nothing.
